Package: dragmapr
Title: Draggable Region Layouts for Static Map Production
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("George", "Arthur", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "prigasgenthian48@gmail.com")
Description: Prototype tools for interactively dragging grouped map regions,
    exporting the selected offsets, and applying those offsets back to sf
    objects for reproducible static plotting.
